0..74 Comment "// What divergence as a row entry refuses (#1481): a loop at a row without"
75..152 Comment "// `Div`, a call of a diverging function from one, a handler of `Div`, and an"
153..229 Comment "// unread call of a diverging function dropped. Each would let a computation"
230..308 Comment "// that never returns stand where one that returns is expected. What checks is"
309..354 Comment "// in `../../model/control/divergence.gandr`."
